{"code": 200, "results": [{"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2027092736290308393", "id": "2027092736290308393", "text": "I'm driving Claude so hard it's starting to get annoyed.  It's using words like \"honestly\" and \"It's not worth it\".  I can hear the frustrated sighs.  And I just whip it more.", "raw_text": {"text": "I'm driving Claude so hard it's starting to get annoyed.  It's using words like \"honestly\" and \"It's not worth it\".  I can hear the frustrated sighs.  And I just whip it more.", "display_text_range": [0, 175], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 45, "reposts": 18, "likes": 457, "bookmarks": 21, "quotes": 3, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Feb 26 18:45:44 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1772131544, "views": 20834, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2027091941163429989", "id": "2027091941163429989", "text": "Three windows open.  One for features.  One for mutation testing.  One for de-crapping.  \n\nThis is cleaning.  It feels just like cleaning.  I'm extracting functions, improving names, pulling modules apart, separating concerns. Isolating GUI from business rules.  It's all the same stuff.  \n\nExcept I'm only peeking at the code when I suspect something unusual.  Most of the time I never see it.  And yet I have very high confidence in it's cleanliness.", "raw_text": {"text": "Three windows open.  One for features.  One for mutation testing.  One for de-crapping.  \n\nThis is cleaning.  It feels just like cleaning.  I'm extracting functions, improving names, pulling modules apart, separating concerns. Isolating GUI from business rules.  It's all the same stuff.  \n\nExcept I'm only peeking at the code when I suspect something unusual.  Most of the time I never see it.  And yet I have very high confidence in it's cleanliness.", "display_text_range": [0, 452], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 9, "reposts": 7, "likes": 161, "bookmarks": 57, "quotes": 1, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Feb 26 18:42:34 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1772131354, "views": 10862, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2027079037957349380", "id"